rong\">Sally</span>: Ok, you're up, V. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, I forgot how heavy these bowling balls were! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I haven't been here in a while! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, it's been ages. I've totally forgotten how to bowl.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn7le03ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: So, my personal trainer has been making me do these workouts every morning. My muscles get so sore. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Have you been losing weight?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Not, really ... I've been gaining muscle mass. That's good, right?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Absolutely! I've been going to a specialized cooking class once a week for the last few months.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh, really? What's so specialized about it?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, the trend of \u201cclean eating\u201d is something for me to consider. I've been thinking about adding new items to the menu at the restaurant. I want to tap into this new market.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That's a great idea! Very savvy! Since you started as the manager, you've become attuned to the business side of the restaurant industry. I'm impressed.", "id": 2, "time": "13500", "image": "engenn7le03ob02re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, thanks. Now, let me impress you with my bowling skills. Be prepared to be amazed!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: If you beat me, I'll take you to the movies! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's a deal!", "id": 3, "time": "58000", "image": "engenn7le03ob02re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le03ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le03ob02re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}